sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Gateway as KServe Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS

    box rgb(230, 245, 255) Built-in Detector Flow
        participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    end

    box rgb(230, 255, 230) HuggingFace Detector Flow
        participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
        participant PyTorch as PyTorch Model<br/>(in-process)
    end

    box rgb(255, 245, 230) LLM Judge Detector Flow
        participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    end

    participant vLLM as vLLM Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3/Minio<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant KServeInit as KServe Storage<br/>Initializer

    Note over KServeInit,S3: Flow 2 - Model Loading (Init Phase)
    KServeInit->>S3: Download model files<br/>HTTP/9000<br/>AWS credentials
    S3-->>KServeInit: Model artifacts
    KServeInit->>HF: Mount to /mnt/models
    HF->>PyTorch: Load model at startup<br/>(AutoModelForSequenceClassification<br/>or TokenClassification<br/>or GraniteForCausalLM)

    Note over Orchestrator,BuiltIn: Flow 1 - Built-in Text Content Detection
    Orchestrator->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward<br/>Platform auth
    KRBAC->>Istio: Authorized request<br/>mTLS
    Istio->>BuiltIn: HTTP/8080<br/>plaintext
    Note right of BuiltIn: RegexDetectorRegistry<br/>(email, CC, SSN, phone, IP)<br/>FileTypeDetectorRegistry<br/>(JSON, XML, YAML)<br/>CustomDetectorRegistry
    BuiltIn-->>Istio: Detection results
    Istio-->>KRBAC: mTLS response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Orchestrator: JSON response<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over Orchestrator,HF: Flow 2 - HuggingFace Model Inference
    Orchestrator->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward<br/>Platform auth
    KRBAC->>Istio: Authorized request<br/>mTLS
    Istio->>HF: HTTP/8000<br/>plaintext
    HF->>PyTorch: Run inference<br/>(in-process)
    PyTorch-->>HF: Classification result
    HF-->>Istio: Detection results
    Istio-->>KRBAC: mTLS response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Orchestrator: JSON response<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over Orchestrator,vLLM: Flow 3 - LLM Judge Evaluation
    Orchestrator->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward<br/>Platform auth
    KRBAC->>Istio: Authorized request<br/>mTLS
    Istio->>Judge: HTTP/8000<br/>plaintext
    Judge->>vLLM: Judge.from_url()<br/>HTTP/8080<br/>No auth (in-cluster)
    vLLM-->>Judge: LLM evaluation result
    Judge-->>Istio: Detection results
    Istio-->>KRBAC: mTLS response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Orchestrator: JSON response<br/>HTTPS/443
